<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT NIGERIA 2-0 IN HASSAN TROPHY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT NIGERIA 2-0 IN HASSAN TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Nigeria 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in Morocco's Hassan II trophy on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Salaheddine Bassir 49, Abdellatif Jrindo 90</p>
<p>Attendance - 75,000</p>
<p>Croatia beat the Czech Republic 4-1 in a penalty shoot-out after the teams were drawing 1-1 after 90 minutes.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Croatia - Radek Drulak (4)</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Pralja Nenad (29)</p>
<p>Attendance - 20,000</p>
</text>
